{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24031","headline":"把酒 · 白居易","name":"把酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把酒仰问天，古今谁不死。\n所贵未死间，少忧多欢喜。\n穷通谅在天，忧喜即由己。\n是故达道人，去彼而取此。\n勿言未富贵，久忝居禄仕。\n借问宗族间，几人拖金紫。\n勿忧渐衰老，且喜加年纪。\n试数班行中，几人及暮齿。\n朝飱不过饱，五鼎徒爲尔。\n夕寝止求安，一衾而已矣。\n此外皆长物，於我云相似。\n有子不留金，何况兼无子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}